<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_19__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(1) Any person who is dissatisfied with the decision of the Collector under section 38A(5) may, within twenty- one days after the person is notified in writing of that decision and upon payment of duty in conformity therewith, appeal against the decision to the High Court by filing a notice of appeal with the High Court and may for that purpose require the Collector to state and sign a case, setting forth the question upon which his opinion was required, and the decision made by him.\"; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_19__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_19> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/msa@> .
